        [3] Effective Test Reporting: Key Components & Best Practices: https://www.practitest.com/resource-center/article/effective-test-reporting/
        [4] What Are Test Reports: With Examples And Best Practices - LambdaTest: https://www.lambdatest.com/learning-hub/test-reports
        [7] Software Testing Reports: 7 Essential Steps for QA Processes - Test Quality: https://testquality.com/software-testing-reports-7-essential-steps/
